[size=4][b]A hand-drawn wood-and-bronze Valheim UI. Norse knotwork boards behind the windows, bronze frames on the bars and food, and every piece placed and sized by you.[/b][/size]

[b]Just want the HUD from before?[/b] Set [b]Panels / newPanels[/b] to false in the config and restart. That keeps the bars, food diamonds, guardian power and edit mode, plus the inventory, hotbar and equipment panel (they hold the new equipment, quick and shield slots), and puts every other screen back to vanilla. The slots stay on either way: turning them off would drop whatever is in them on the ground.

[size=4][b]Read before installing[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Remove Equipment and Quick Slots and Shield Me Bruh first.[/b] Their slots are built in now. If either is still installed, BepInEx skips [i]this[/i] mod and starts the game without it.[/*]
[*][b]Uninstalling drops what is in the equipment, quick and shield slots[/b] on the ground where you log in (the same as removing Equipment and Quick Slots). Take your gear off first, or pick it back up.[/*]
[*]Made for GUI scale 100%. Above about 130% the crafting and equipment panels overlap.[/*]
[*]Not every screen is reskinned yet - see below.[/*]
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jekkle/cartur-ui-hud/master/docs/images/ui-inventory-crafting.png[/img]

[size=4][b]What you get[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]HUD[/b] - health, stamina, eitr and adrenaline bars in bronze frames that grow with your maximum; three food diamonds with countdowns; the guardian power with Ready or cooldown.[/*]
[*][b]Inventory[/b] - bag, hotbar and an equipment panel with your character live in it, plus equipment, quick (Z / V / B) and shield slots. The quick slots are the food diamonds.[/*]
[*][b]Crafting, chests, the trader[/b] - on painted boards, controls seated on their plates.[/*]
[*][b]Build menu, skills, compendium, popups, pause and settings menus, loading and sleep screens[/b] - on the same boards.[/*]
[*][b]Epic Loot's enchanting table and trader windows[/b], when Epic Loot is installed - one board per enchanting tab.[/*]
[*][b]HD Valheim Textures without the freeze[/b] - its textures load during the logo screen with a progress bar, instead of the game hanging for half a minute or more on the main menu.[/*]
[*]A hover effect on every button, and a bronze highlight on the selected row.[/*]
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jekkle/cartur-ui-hud/master/docs/images/ui-enchanting-table.png[/img]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jekkle/cartur-ui-hud/master/docs/images/ui-build-menu.png[/img]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jekkle/cartur-ui-hud/master/docs/images/hud-closeup.png[/img]

[b]Still on vanilla art:[/b] the large map and minimap frames, the connecting screen, and some small dialogs. Controllers work, but the mod is made and tested with mouse and keyboard.

[size=4][b]Arranging it[/b][/size]

Turn on [b]editMode[/b] in the config - with Configuration Manager that is a tick box in game, or edit the config file and it applies immediately without a restart.

[list]
[*][b]drag[/b] - move a piece[/*]
[*][b]wheel[/b] - size it[/*]
[*][b]shift + wheel[/b] - a bar's length[/*]
[*][b]ctrl + wheel[/b] - how far the frame's ornaments stand off the fill[/*]
[*][b]ctrl + drag[/b] - nudge the frame against the fill[/*]
[/list]

Player input is held while edit mode is on, so a drag does not swing your axe. Turn it off when you are done; the layout saves either way. [b]resetLayout[/b] puts every piece back.

[size=4][b]Config[/b][/size]

BepInEx/config/com.jekkle.valheim.carturuihud.cfg

[list]
[*][b]Panels / newPanels[/b] (true) - off: HUD, slots, inventory, hotbar and equipment panel only. Restart to apply.[/*]
[*][b]Layout / editMode[/b] (false) - arrange the pieces. See above.[/*]
[*][b]Layout / resetLayout[/b] (false) - tick to put every piece back.[/*]
[*][b]Art / darkMode[/b] (false) - keep vanilla's dimmed panel material.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Compatibility[/b][/size]

Declared incompatible, so BepInEx skips this mod if one of these is installed: [b]Auga[/b], [b]AugaLite[/b], [b]Equipment and Quick Slots[/b], [b]Shield Me Bruh[/b].

Works alongside [b]Epic Loot[/b], [b]Jotunn[/b], [b]BetterArchery[/b] (its quiver sits in three ammo cells of the equipment panel), [b]HD Valheim Textures[/b] and [b]Cartur's Waste Management[/b] (its trash can and sort button sit in the inventory's side column). Any other mod that redraws the same windows will fight it.

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]

Requires BepInEx. Unpack into your Valheim folder so the DLL lands in BepInEx/plugins/CarturUIHud, with its assets folder beside it. Client-side; no server install needed, works in multiplayer.

